    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, quick question. i have stage 2 hypertension so i'm on lisinopril daily, but i've got this awful sinus infection and cant breathe. is it okay to take some sudafed to help clear it up? just wondering if it'll clash with my meds.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
